OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A70,000 social and affordable homes to
OL,4,Abe built across England as part of
OL,5,A#39bn plan
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the first part of a wider plan to
OL,8,Fbuild 300,000 social and affordable
OL,9,Fhomes across the nation, under the
OL,10,Fgovernment's #39bn social housebuilding
OL,11,Fprogramme.
OL,13,FHousing charities welcomed the news but
OL,14,Fsaid it was still not enough to meet
OL,15,Fdemand, while the Conservatives said it
OL,16,Fwas an "unfunded spending commitment".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
